    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you on the consistency thing but i feel like i'm being too cautious. my doctor didn't really say i couldn't eat more greens, they just said to watch it. if i just stick to a big spinach juice once a day every single morning, wouldn't that just become my new \"consistent\" baseline? it seems like as long as i do it the same way every day, the warfarin should just adjust to it. i just really want to make sure i'm doing everything i can to stay healthy.",
